{"4218680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bird Game 3", "steam_appid": 4218680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218680/extras/c0a986bf3d91e6982f4914c42e555f63.poster.avif?t=1782635445\" width=1080 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218680/extras/c0a986bf3d91e6982f4914c42e555f63.webm?t=1782635445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218680/extras/c0a986bf3d91e6982f4914c42e555f63.mp4?t=1782635445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ultimate Friendslop Chaos – Dive in with your flock of friends!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bird Game 3 is a multiplayer game where you and your friends battle in an asymmetric game mode for eggs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Eagle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mighty eagle has to protect its nest at all costs! Use the powerful Eagle Eye Ability to keep an eye on your eggs, as well as possible intruders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ravens</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The other players get to play together as ravens. Teamwork is key. Spot the egg, fly in – and poop back out. The ravens get a unique speed boost ability – powered by poop. Now they have to escape with the egg and throw it in a giant pool of lava!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218680/extras/90319a72d1bc5f80ca37fec36faecd4b.poster.avif?t=1782635445\" width=1080 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218680/extras/90319a72d1bc5f80ca37fec36faecd4b.webm?t=1782635445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218680/extras/90319a72d1bc5f80ca37fec36faecd4b.mp4?t=1782635445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize &amp; Hang out</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your bird in the lobby, where you can hang out pre game, play around or try to complete the race challenge with a new record time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218680/extras/923e6a5d7c89c345b43b7066f23b20ca.poster.avif?t=1782635445\" width=1080 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218680/extras/923e6a5d7c89c345b43b7066f23b20ca.webm?t=1782635445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218680/extras/923e6a5d7c89c345b43b7066f23b20ca.mp4?t=1782635445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2 – 8 Players</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bird Game 3 is best enjoyed with a minimum of 4 players, but lobbies can support groups of up to 8 of you! Dive in and happy plucking!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218680/extras/c0a986bf3d91e6982f4914c42e555f63.poster.avif?t=1782635445\" width=1080 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218680/extras/c0a986bf3d91e6982f4914c42e555f63.webm?t=1782635445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218680/extras/c0a986bf3d91e6982f4914c42e555f63.mp4?t=1782635445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ultimate Friendslop Chaos – Dive in with your flock of friends!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bird Game 3 is a multiplayer game where you and your friends battle in an asymmetric game mode for eggs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Eagle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mighty eagle has to protect its nest at all costs! Use the powerful Eagle Eye Ability to keep an eye on your eggs, as well as possible intruders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ravens</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The other players get to play together as ravens. Teamwork is key. Spot the egg, fly in – and poop back out. The ravens get a unique speed boost ability – powered by poop. Now they have to escape with the egg and throw it in a giant pool of lava!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218680/extras/90319a72d1bc5f80ca37fec36faecd4b.poster.avif?t=1782635445\" width=1080 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218680/extras/90319a72d1bc5f80ca37fec36faecd4b.webm?t=1782635445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4218680/extras/90319a72d1bc5f80ca37fec36faecd4b.mp4?t=1782635445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize &amp; Hang out</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your bird in the lobby, where you can hang out pre game, play around or try to complete the race challenge with a new record time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\"